### Test de notifications de changement de statut d'intervention

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlNDg3YjVjYy0xZGY0LTQ2NTAtYTFmNy1hNzk5ODU5YmUyMjEiLCJlbWFpbCI6Imxvb25hNzc1N0BnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJwaG9uZSI6IisyMjc2OTg3NjU0MzIiLCJyb2xlIjoiQURNSU4iLCJpYXQiOjE3Nzc0Nzg3MTAsImV4cCI6MTc3OTI5MzExMH0.orNbodFWVQxl-_wmy-8oe8B4OHQ9J6U6Nyhwotc82GQ
@interventionId = INTERVENTION_ID_HERE

### 1. Mettre à jour le statut vers EN_COURS (doit envoyer INTERVENTION_STARTED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interventions/{{interventionId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "EN_COURS",
  "comment": "Intervention démarrée"
}

### 2. Mettre à jour le statut vers EN_ATTENTE (doit envoyer INTERVENTION_STATUS_CHANGED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interventions/{{interventionId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "EN_ATTENTE",
  "comment": "Intervention mise en attente"
}

### 3. Mettre à jour le statut vers RESOLU (doit envoyer INTERVENTION_STATUS_CHANGED + INTERVENTION_COMPLETED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interventions/{{interventionId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "RESOLU",
  "comment": "Intervention terminée avec succès"
}

### 4. Mettre à jour le statut vers ANNULE (doit envoyer INTERVENTION_STATUS_CHANGED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interventions/{{interventionId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "ANNULE",
  "comment": "Intervention annulée"
}

### 5. Lister les interventions pour trouver un ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/interventions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Vérifier les notifications de l'utilisateur (citoyen)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/user/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Vérifier les notifications de l'agent
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/user/AGENT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Test direct d'événement de notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/test
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": "USER_ID_HERE",
  "event": "INTERVENTION_STATUS_CHANGED",
  "data": {
    "interventionId": "test_intervention_123",
    "referenceCode": "REP-001",
    "status": "EN_COURS",
    "reporterId": "USER_ID_HERE",
    "agentId": "AGENT_ID_HERE"
  }
}
